 * │ when │ who │ action │ entity │ before → after │ ▸ │
 * │ Append-only. View-only for every role including   │
 * │ Owner. No edit, no delete, no bulk action         │
 * │ anywhere on this page.                            │
 * └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
