                  KYC and Type stay for every role: a status and a category,
                  both already drawn ungated on the table itself.
                */}
                <div style={{ display: 'grid', gridTemplateColumns: '1fr 1fr', gap: 'var(--sp-md)', fontSize: 'var(--t-meta)' }}>
